{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oblitus mortis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mythological creatures and legends from Venezuelan folklore, explore this entire interconnected world and enjoy a game in the purest style of the <strong>Metroidvanias</strong> classics, with a cute little twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new and different <strong>weapons</strong>, unlock secrets with each enemy you defeat, wear different <strong>hats and masks</strong> to improve your <strong>skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/5d95bda824852493bb3793da0e9c29e0.poster.avif?t=1747665983\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/5d95bda824852493bb3793da0e9c29e0.webm?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/5d95bda824852493bb3793da0e9c29e0.mp4?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face legendary creatures such as <strong>La Llorona</strong>, whose lament torments the forests, <strong>Dr. Knoche</strong> and his Galip\u00e1n mummies, <strong>the Hachero</strong>.\u00a0 Every enemy, every area, every Object is filled with folklore and mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/0f76aee8c53a7874146266aafd1033ea.poster.avif?t=1747665983\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/0f76aee8c53a7874146266aafd1033ea.webm?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/0f76aee8c53a7874146266aafd1033ea.mp4?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark world inspired by the legends and myths of Venezuela. With pixel art graphics, this game will take you to explore the most mysterious and dangerous corners of this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/07616f793fbe28f936b6e0123e4f08bc.poster.avif?t=1747665983\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/07616f793fbe28f936b6e0123e4f08bc.webm?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/07616f793fbe28f936b6e0123e4f08bc.mp4?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pluck the Crow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/6f25b7dee899705aa3a83d8225020bd02d424fb4.jpg"},{"name":"El Pez que Fuma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/078d6c3e10521532e0f50815a8b78dc12d248435.jpg"},{"name":"Legend of Dr. Knoche","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/b28ff7c797e694f054dc7febb948310c04717e94.jpg"},{"name":"Why are you crying LLORONA?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/bcbaae3c04a8dfa4f982d983955c4682137b8e56.jpg"},{"name":"A shot of moonshine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/50c0f40dbef9daf5aa96a9acccf0b2c4d2145f8a.jpg"},{"name":"First prayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/8b2992c778086cebdca7a706692408be4d427a52.jpg"},{"name":"Merciful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/dc8986af6ba696afd4583ef263e463568b13dba6.jpg"},{"name":"Wandering Monk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/511dc80f925c4a8a58d6ff60f757921590277730.jpg"},{"name":"Down with the Revolution!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/e8549bbbbfbbce1658eafaf454ba6de6c5eda310.jpg"},{"name":"The full bag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3434340/4343b74ec8ebb5a3212bfaeb820e1d26d980abd5.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3434340?t=1747665983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/1a0289c721b44133d7a1f0608fc09883b1d4c6df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747665983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/eabb3e938ae9ab42b41a1f1a049463f13d323fe6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747665983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/eabb3e938ae9ab42b41a1f1a049463f13d323fe6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747665983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Oblitus mortis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mythological creatures and legends from Venezuelan folklore, explore this entire interconnected world and enjoy a game in the purest style of the <strong>Metroidvanias</strong> classics, with a cute little twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new and different <strong>weapons</strong>, unlock secrets with each enemy you defeat, wear different <strong>hats and masks</strong> to improve your <strong>skills</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/5d95bda824852493bb3793da0e9c29e0.poster.avif?t=1747665983\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/5d95bda824852493bb3793da0e9c29e0.webm?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/5d95bda824852493bb3793da0e9c29e0.mp4?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face legendary creatures such as <strong>La Llorona</strong>, whose lament torments the forests, <strong>Dr. Knoche</strong> and his Galip\u00e1n mummies, <strong>the Hachero</strong>.\u00a0 Every enemy, every area, every Object is filled with folklore and mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/0f76aee8c53a7874146266aafd1033ea.poster.avif?t=1747665983\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/0f76aee8c53a7874146266aafd1033ea.webm?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434340/extras/0f76aee8c53a7874146266aafd1033ea.mp4?t=1747665983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark world inspired by the legends and myths of Venezuela. With pixel art graphics, this game will take you to explore the most mysterious and dangerous corners of this land.</p><p class=\"bb_